{"availability":"available","full":"ValgulNecron/Gameplane","name":"Gameplane","description":"Kubernetes-native game server control panel. Idle auto-sleep with wake-on-connect, restic backups, OIDC + RBAC, OCI game templates, relay tunnels. Open-source (AGPL-3.0) alternative to CubeCoders AMP and Pterodactyl that runs the same way on a k3s homelab and a multi-node cluster. Beta.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":10,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-22T22:19:06Z","updated":"2026-10-07T00:53:52Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://valgulnecron.github.io/gameplane-website/","topics":["amp-alternative","control-panel","game-panel","game-server","game-server-management","game-servers","go","golang","helm","homelab","k3s","kubernetes","kubernetes-operator","operator","pterodactyl","pterodactyl-alternative","react","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://valgulnecron.github.io/gameplane-website/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.439Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.439Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.439Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.439Z","stars":10,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Kubernetes-native game server control panel. Open-source alternative to CubeCoders AMP with a K8s backend instead of Docker — scales from a single-node k3s homelab to multi-node production clusters without changing the operational model.","Status: pre-v1 release (v0.3.0). The operator, API, agent, and dashboard are feature-complete for the v1 scope and stabilized for external testing. See Pre-v1 status & known limitations before running it for anything you can't afford to lose.","Website: — features, docs, and comparisons. Source lives in gameplane-website, mounted here as the website/ submodule."],"features":["Graceful Lifecycle Management: Create, start, stop, restart, clone, and delete game servers. Stopping or restarting executes the 